      "en": "Saul, and Jonathan his son, and the people who were present with them, stayed in Geba of Benjamin; but the Philistines encamped in Michmash.",
      "ko": "사울과 그 아들 요나단과 그들과 함께한 백성은 베냐민 게바에 있고 블레셋 사람은 믹마스에 진 쳤더니",
      "source_text_hash": "f8c4e40388642a331d811bfd74d52fc5fb2a7a23a1c9a57f04349f43768db10a",
      "translation_text_hash": "eb2b611c6b9f413f800b7ed56eb9dbb4ac52a6d4f52579625dc41a18d1ee9ccd",
