      "en": "The price was one payim each to sharpen mattocks, plowshares, pitchforks, axes, and goads.",
      "ko": "곧 그들이 괭이나 삽이나 쇠스랑이나 도끼나 쇠채찍이 무딜 때에 그리하였으므로",
      "source_text_hash": "0356e41ee54c99026cea704d8a0d2d5cf557065ec23e54916e71712f77893702",
      "translation_text_hash": "75a5508629f54468c9a8031991b3d9370e805279b1910c241ce8b6fe6acb9ec2",
