      "en": "So it came to pass in the day of battle that neither sword nor spear was found in the hand of any of the people who were with Saul and Jonathan; but Saul and Jonathan his son had them.",
      "ko": "싸우는 날에 사울과 요나단과 함께한 백성의 손에는 칼이나 창이 없고 오직 사울과 그 아들 요나단에게만 있으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "6efa25306aa63bd4398382dd35b1d63745f1a23844b78e8f9d3f0f15f9296f80",
      "translation_text_hash": "1e3ea1787292c9f00140a13b96f2a86016e1bbd8a0aefd44e743b397f4c55dde",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
